{"id":"17-2850-2-22","zh":"依“kvaci dhātū”等规则，gamu 词根在不定过去时中以 gā 替换：so ajjhagā（他证得了），后面的语尾省略；te ajjhaguṃ（他们证得了）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2850-23-28","zh":"tvaṃ ajjhago（你证得了），tumhe ajjhaguttha（你们证得了）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2850-29-34","zh":"ahaṃ ajjhagiṃ（我证得了），mayaṃ ajjhagumha（我们证得了）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2851-2-12","zh":"在为自言中：so agacchittha、gacchittha、agañchittha、gañchittha 等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2851-13-32","zh":"不作 cchā 替换时：so agamittha、gamittha、agamā、gamā；te agamū、gamū、ajjhagū、agū。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2851-33-41","zh":"tvaṃ agamise、gamise；agamivhaṃ、gamivhaṃ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2851-42-57","zh":"ahaṃ agamaṃ、gamaṃ、agama、gama，或 ajjhagaṃ；agamimhe、gamimhe。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2852-2-21","zh":"在被动语态中：gāmo agacchīyittha tena（村子被他走到了），以及 gacchīyittha、agañchiyittha、gañchiyittha、agamīyittha、gamīyittha、agamittha、gamittha 等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2852-22-38","zh":"作为为他言时：agacchīyi 或 gacchīyi，agamīyi 或 gamīyi；agacchīyuṃ 或 agamīyuṃ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2852-39-44","zh":"同样：aghammīyi、aghammīyiṃsu 等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2853-2-12","zh":"“hiyyattanī、ajjatanī”这两项从上文延续下来。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2854-2-8","zh":"471. 与 mā 连用时，在一切时间中也可用。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2855-2-16","zh":"凡是与 mā 连用时，过去时与不定过去时的语尾在一切时间中都可使用；由于 ca 字，命令语气（pañcamī）的语尾也可以。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2855-17-43","zh":"在 mā bhavati、mā bhavā、mā bhavissati 的意义上，用过去时、不定过去时、命令语气的语尾，其余的可以类推：so mā bhavā、mā bhavī，mā te bhavantvantarāyā（愿你们不要有障碍）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2855-44-52","zh":"mā pacā、mā pacī、mā pacatu（不要煮）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2855-53-61","zh":"mā gacchā、mā gacchī、mā gacchatu（不要去）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2855-62-77","zh":"mā kañci pāpamāgamā（不要犯任何恶），mā agami、mā gamā、mā gamī、mā gametu。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2855-78-88","zh":"tvaṃ mā gaccho、mā gacchi、mā gacchāhi 等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2856-2-3","zh":"以上是过去时类语尾。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2857-2-21","zh":"472. 未来时：ssati、ssanti，ssasi、ssatha，ssāmi、ssāma，ssate、ssante，ssase、ssavhe，ssaṃ、ssāmhe。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2858-2-8","zh":"ssati 等十二个语尾称为未来时（bhavissantī）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2858-9-18","zh":"“将会存在”就是 bhavissanto（将来者）；由于表示那个时间，这个语尾被称为**未来时**。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2859-2-7","zh":"473. 在未来时间中用未来时。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2860-2-7","zh":"在未来时间中，用未来时语尾。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2861-2-6","zh":"在过去时间中也用未来时，这是由于想要表达那个时间；","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-2862-2-10","zh":"例如在“anekajātisaṃsāraṃ sandhāvissaṃ（我曾在多生的轮回中流转）”等句中。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2863-2-22","zh":"“尚未到来”就是未来（anāgata），意思是：条件和合时，将来应当生起的；加 i 字增音，元音强化并以 ava 替换，以及元音省略等。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-2864-2-5","zh":"bhavissati、bhavissanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2864-6-9","zh":"bhavissasi、bhavissatha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2864-10-13","zh":"bhavissāmi、bhavissāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2864-14-17","zh":"bhavissate、bhavissante。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2864-18-21","zh":"bhavissase、bhavissavhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2864-22-25","zh":"bhavissaṃ、bhavissāmhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2865-2-11","zh":"在被动语态中省略 ya 词缀：sukhaṃ tayā anubhavissate（快乐将被你感受），anubhavissante。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2865-12-15","zh":"anubhavissase、anubhavissavhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2865-16-19","zh":"anubhavissaṃ、anubhavissāmhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2865-20-26","zh":"作为为他言时：anubhavissati devadattena（将被提婆达多感受），anubhavissanti 等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2865-27-37","zh":"在无人称语态中：bhavissate tena；不省略 ya 词缀时：anubhūyissate、anubhūyissante 等。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2865-38-40","zh":"在无人称语态中：bhūyissate。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2866-2-6","zh":"同样：pacissati、pacissanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2866-7-10","zh":"pacissasi、pacissatha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2866-11-14","zh":"pacissāmi、pacissāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2866-15-18","zh":"pacissate、pacissante。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2866-19-22","zh":"pacissase、pacissavhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2866-23-26","zh":"pacissaṃ、pacissāmhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2867-2-9","zh":"在被动语态中：paccissate odano devadattena（饭将被提婆达多煮），paccissante 等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2867-10-14","zh":"作为为他言时：paccissati、paccissanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2867-15-18","zh":"paccissasi、paccissatha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2867-19-22","zh":"paccissāmi、paccissāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2868-2-5","zh":"gacchissati、gacchissanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2868-6-9","zh":"gacchissasi、gacchissatha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2868-10-13","zh":"gacchissāmi、gacchissāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2868-14-17","zh":"gacchissate、gacchissante。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2868-18-21","zh":"gacchissase、gacchissavhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2868-22-25","zh":"gacchissaṃ、gacchissāmhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2868-26-31","zh":"so saggaṃ gamissati（他将去天界），gamissanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2868-32-35","zh":"gamissasi、gamissatha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2868-36-40","zh":"gamissāmi、gamissāma 等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2869-2-6","zh":"在被动语态中：gacchīyissate、gacchīyissante。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2869-7-15","zh":"或者 gacchīyissati、gacchīyissanti；gamīyissate、gamīyissante。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2869-16-21","zh":"或者 gamīyissati、gamīyissanti 等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2869-22-28","zh":"省略 ya 词缀时：gamissate、gamissante。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2869-29-33","zh":"或者 gamissati、gamissanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2869-34-39","zh":"同样：ghammissati、ghammissanti 等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2870-2-3","zh":"以上是未来时语尾。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2871-2-21","zh":"484. 条件时：ssā、ssaṃsu，sse、ssatha，ssaṃ、ssāmhā，ssatha、ssisu，ssase、ssavhe，ssiṃ、ssāmhase。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2872-2-8","zh":"ssā 等十二个语尾称为条件时（kālātipatti）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2872-9-28","zh":"时间的错失就是 kālātipatti；它是指由于遇到相违的条件，或者由于原因不具足，动作没有得以完成；因为表示这一点，这个语尾被称为**条件时**。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-2873-2-7","zh":"475. 动作落空而属于过去时，用条件时。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-2874-2-8","zh":"只在动作落空的过去时间中，用条件时语尾。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2874-9-18","zh":"动作的落空就是 kriyātipanna；它是指由于缺乏成就的能力，动作完全没有生起。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-2874-19-33","zh":"这里应当理解：虽然这个动作不能用“过去”一词来称呼，但是就阻碍该动作生起的那个动作而言，凭着时间的区分，仍然可以有“过去”的称谓。","confidence":60}
{"id":"17-2875-2-31","zh":"ssā 是条件时、为他言、第三人称单数的语尾；加 a 字与 i 字增音，元音强化并以 ava 替换；依“kvaci dhātū”等规则，ssā、ssāmhā 这些语尾有时变为短音，sse 语尾有时变为 a。","confidence":60}
{"id":"17-2876-2-26","zh":"so ce paṭhamavaye pabbajjaṃ alabhissa, arahā abhavissa（如果他在青年时得到出家，他就会成为阿罗汉），也作 bhavissa、abhavissā 或 bhavissā；te ce taṃ alabhissaṃsu, arahanto abhavissaṃsu（如果他们得到出家，他们就会成为阿罗汉），也作 bhavissaṃsu。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2876-27-40","zh":"同样：tvaṃ abhavissa、bhavissa 或 abhavisse；tumhe abhavissatha、bhavissatha。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2876-41-56","zh":"ahaṃ abhavissaṃ、bhavissaṃ；mayaṃ abhavissamha、bhavissamha，或 abhavissāmhā、bhavissāmhā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2876-57-61","zh":"so abhavissatha，abhavissisu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2876-62-65","zh":"abhavissase、abhavissavhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2876-66-69","zh":"abhavissiṃ、abhavissāmhase。","confidence":90}
